    "source_inspection_debt": {
      "_why": "Files that already used `inspect.getsource` when this gate was introduced. Source inspection asserts that a STRING appears in a FILE: it cannot tell you the code runs, is reachable, or is correct. A few of these are legitimate structural invariants nothing else can express (\"every provider mutation is preceded by the gate\"); the rest are behavioural claims wearing a grep. This list is a RATCHET \u2014 the runner fails if it grows, so the debt is visible and bounded while it is paid down one file at a time.",
